#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:1
msgid "Qingpu science and technology authority"
msgstr "青浦区科学技术委员会"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:4
msgid "青浦区科学技术委员会"
msgstr "青浦区科学技术委员会"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:6
msgid "Government | Qingpu | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "政府部门｜青浦区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:8
msgid ""
"Xicen links the Lianqiu Lake research center with an emerging innovation "
"district. The official 2025 reply discusses early investment and "
"technology transfer, but proposed funds are not treated here as open "
"startup applications."
msgstr "西岑联动练秋湖研发中心与科创片区。2025年官方答复讨论早期投资及技术转移，本书不将研究设立的基金视为正在受理的创业项目。"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Evidence S022 "
"<https://www.shqp.gov.cn/shqp/zwgk/tabl/sbljg/20250603/1283025.html>`_. "
"对市政协十四届三次会议 第0746号提案的答复_市建议提案办理结果_意见提案办理_政务公开_上海市青浦区人民政府."
msgstr "`证据 S022 <https://www.shqp.gov.cn/shqp/zwgk/tabl/sbljg/20250603/1283025.html>`_. 对市政协十四届三次会议 第0746号提案的答复_市建议提案办理结果_意见提案办理_政务公开_上海市青浦区人民政府."

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:12
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:15
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:17
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:19
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:22
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://www.shqp.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官网／对接入口 <https://www.shqp.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:24
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网联系负责团队，确认现行申请渠道。本刊不刊载邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:26
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:28
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../entities/government-qingpu.rst:41
msgid ":doc:`Qingpu district route </districts/qingpu>`"
msgstr ":doc:`青浦区对接路径 </districts/qingpu>`"

